# Data host for production builds. `VITE_DATA_BASE= npm run build` (empty) makes a bundle
# that reads /data on its own origin, which is what `npm run preview` serves locally.
# The packs live in a Backblaze B2 bucket served through cloud2.databio.org (see README, Deploy).
VITE_DATA_BASE=https://cloud2.databio.org/qtl-browser
